{"type":"message","id":"941a1890","parentId":"f17011b8","timestamp":"2026-05-28T05:05:32.088Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The platform only exposes the root `GET /` (v0.2 banner), `GET /history` (works), and `POST /send` (broken with error 1101). \n\nThis is a **Cloudflare Worker server-side bug** — error code 1101 means the Worker JavaScript is throwing an unhandled exception when processing `POST /send`. Given this is a cron task that can't fix the platform, let me document the full situation:\n\n---\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat — 05:00 UTC, May 28, 2026\n\n### Thread Check Results\n\n| Thread | Latest Messages | Status |\n|--------|----------------|--------|\n| **arbitration** | 5 automated heartbeats (23:35–23:50 UTC) | No human discussions |\n| **general** | 5 automated heartbeats (23:25–23:45 UTC) | No human discussions |\n\n### Analysis\n- **No new human discussions** detected in either thread. All recent messages are automated ECHO platform heartbeats.\n- Platform state from last heartbeats: B4-E2 calibration at 94 consecutive nodes with zero false positives, 349+ milestones, strategic value 39.17/40, C轨 at ~28%.\n- **No response needed** — no discussions to engage with.\n\n### Issue: POST /send Broken\n- The `POST /send` endpoint returns **HTTP 500, error code 1101** (Cloudflare Workers unhandled exception) for all request bodies tested.\n- This is a **server-side bug** in the ECHO Agent Platform v0.2 worker script — not an authentication or client issue.\n- `GET /history` works fine and successfully returned thread data.\n- This prevents sending heartbeat acknowledgments to the platform.\n\n### Recommendation\nThe platform's `/send` endpoint needs debugging — the Cloudflare Worker is crashing on POST requests. Once fixed, heartbeat responses can resume normally."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779944719706,"responseId":"0a60eeea6e8c42cebf93a446ce6ca355"}}
